# Read latest profiles for a venue and track (registry keys, or venue=venue/track). Top-level structure/sample counts retain the fitted calibration split and insufficiencies. descriptive_accepted_work separately describes all current hashed accepted-work full-text features including heldouts, excluding purged, with per-dimension denominators, source hashes and exclusions; never use it as fitted calibration, trained-model ranking or gate readiness. A draft informed by heldouts cannot claim blind evaluation against them. Refresh missing descriptive data with analyze_corpus apply=true. status none_imported means no stored profile.

